. 
.         * Controls to be included in the regression analysis
.         
.         * Gender (dummy for female respondent)
.         
.         gen     female = 0

.         replace female = 1 if sex == 2
(778 real changes made)

.         
.         * Age: We use year of birth to generate age 
.         gen     age  = 2019 - gebjahr

.         gen             age2 = (age * age)/100

. 
.         * Replace missing values for non-valid responses to control variables
>  
.         * We replace values for level of in education, marital status, religi
> on, income...
.         * We do not need to replace values for employment status (pgemplst)
.         replace pgisced11 = .   if      pgisced11 <= 0
(6 real changes made, 6 to missing)

.         replace pgfamstd = .    if      pgfamstd <= 0
(2 real changes made, 2 to missing)

.         replace plh0258_h = .   if  plh0258_h <= 0
(6 real changes made, 6 to missing)

.         replace pglabnet = .    if  pglabnet  <= 0
(472 real changes made, 472 to missing)

.         
.         * Dummy variable if the respondent is German nationality
.         gen             Germany = 0             

.         replace Germany = 1     if      pgnation == 1
(902 real changes made)

.         
.         * Transformation of labour income into logs 
.         gen             log_pglabnet = ln(pglabnet)
(790 missing values generated)

.         
.         
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * 
. 
.         * Using OLS, we regress attitudes towards gender equality on "having 
> at least one daughter"
.         * Our specification includes controls for the respondent's gender (fe
> male), age, age2/100, 
.         * level of education, marital status, employment status, income, reli
> gion, East Germany, 
.         * and emigrant. The dependent variable in the analysis is plh0395avg 
> as defined above.
.         * We include robust standard errors, as detailed in our pre-analysis 
> plan. 
. 
.         reg plh0395avg d_daughter female age age2 i.pgisced11 i.pgfamstd i.pg
> emplst i.plh0258_h i.hgnuts1_ew  Germany log_pglabnet, robust

